  "description": {
    "text": "Special Card Set Mewtwo V-UNION, Greninja V-UNION and Zacian V-UNION, released on 20 August 2021, brought the Pokémon V-UNION: four different cards that are played together as one Pokémon. They can't be played from the hand; once all four pieces are in the discard pile, they go onto the Bench as one Pokémon, with high HP and four attacks, once a game for each name, and give up three Prize cards when Knocked Out. Each set held one V-UNION's four cards, a Professor Burnet promo and three packs each of Skyscraping Perfection and Blue Sky Stream.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: スペシャルカードセット ミュウツーV-UNION、スペシャルカードセット ゲッコウガV-UNION、スペシャルカードセット ザシアンV-UNION",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20210612043349/https://www.pokemon-card.com/products/s/sp5.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: 商品情報 (product list, December 2022)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20221218063730/https://www.pokemon-card.com/products/"
      },
      {
        "title": "Wikipedia (Japanese): ポケモンカードゲームの発売タイトル一覧",
        "url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9D%E3%82%B1%E3%83%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89%E3%82%B2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A0%E3%81%AE%E7%99%BA%E5%A3%B2%E3%82%BF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%88%E3%83%AB%E4%B8%80%E8%A6%A7"
